description: "guarantees[8]: Canonical Representation,Language Independent,Framework Independent,Graph Native,Deterministic,Explainable,Composable,Immutable Identity"
spec:
  id: engineering_knowledge_record
  version: 1.0.0
  status: stable
  priority: highest
  module: Ontology
  compiler_stage: Canonical Representation
  description: "\"Defines the canonical Engineering Knowledge Record (EKR), the fundamental knowledge object of the TOON Dataset Compiler. Every piece of engineering knowledge ultimately compiles into one or more Engineering Knowledge Records. The EKR is immutable, graph-native, explainable, versioned and composable.\""
purpose: "\"Represent engineering knowledge in its complete form, preserving not only information, but reasoning, decisions, assumptions, tradeoffs, evidence, validation, outcomes and learning.\""
graph: "\"Every EKR has\"[6]: Parent,Children,Related EKRs,Capability Links,Domain Links,Knowledge Links"
success: Every engineering experience can be represented as one or more EKRs.
future:
  graph_embeddings: true
  probabilistic_reasoning: true
  automatic_linking: true
  continuous_evolution: true
  lifelong_learning: true
